            },
            "stem": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The compounds that are released as scents by <i>P.</i> <i>axillaris</i> are lipids.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 20
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Outline how <i>P.</i> <i>axillaris</i> could control the production of scent chemicals by regulating gene expression, so that scent chemicals are synthesised <b>only</b> at night.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 20
                }
              }
            ],
            "marks": 3,
