                "<b>2 ALLOW </b>activator / repressor",
                "<b>5 </b>e.g. light detected / light receptor / phytochrome",
                "e.g. clock genes",
                "e.g. negative feedback",
                "e.g. mRNA / protein, degradation (<i>→</i> daily cycle)"
